        "official_en_sha256": "663dd3d3e301d95b226bf97463f2141255351e5b8cf57f182f0dbf853040baa7"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "なんかすごいことになったな……。",
        "official_en": "Well, that’s not something that happens every day...",
