      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "フィーナの力が必要だ。一緒に戦ってほしい。",
        "official_en": "Right, we’ll need to rely on your strength now more than ever, Fina.",
        "real_en": "We need your strength, Fina. I want you to fight alongside us."
